        "Name": "use_cases",
        "ValueType": "array",
        "StringValue": null,
        "JsonValue": "[\"**Pin a new role archetype.** Add a row to `RoleArchetypes` (e.g., *'Site Reliability Architect'*) with positive/negative signals and a natural-language description. The next search run embeds it into ChromaDB and starts scoring listings against the new target — no code change.\", \"**Penalize a phrase you keep seeing.** Edit `RubricDimensions.culture-work-model.SignalsNegative` to add *'4+ days on-site'*. Every previously scored listing's `NegativeScore` updates the next time `FinalScore` recomputes, and below-threshold rows fall off the corkboard.\", \"**Teach the loop with a 'yes'.** Mark a `Decisions` row as `yes` for *CloudScale's Staff Platform Engineer*. `IsScoringSignal` flips to TRUE; the listing's `FullText` joins the accepted-decisions ChromaDB collection; next run's `HistoryScore` favors textually similar postings.\", \"**Disqualify a listing without deleting it.** Set `ScoreResults.IsDisqualified=TRUE` with a reason. `FinalScore` collapses to `0.0` the next read; the audit row stays for review; nothing else in the pipeline needs to know.\", \"**Retune the weighted fusion.** Change `SearchRuns.NegativeWeight` from `1.0` to `1.5` for the next run; the `FinalScore` formula re-fires across every `ScoreResults` row in that run with the harsher penalty — no scorer redeploy.\"]"
